BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Faculty Staff Help Center] Finding Support as a Family Caregiver:
  Accessing Resources and Coping with Challenges
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T131500
DTSTAMP:20260811T142013Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53484016634912-53484016634913@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, unpaid caregivers provide an estimated $870 billio
 n worth of labor attending to loved ones. Family caregivers often juggle w
 ork\, household responsibilities\, and child rearing along with caregiving
  and\, as a result\, may sacrifice their own well-being. In this presentat
 ion\, Christina Irving will present community services that support family
  caregivers and describe ways to cope with some of the challenges.\n\nAges
 : All ages\nLast synced: 2026-08-11 07:20 PDT
END:VEVENT
