DTSTAMP:20260811T142013Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52901301947089-52901301949140@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Do you often feel overwhelmed\, stretched too thin\, or find y
 ourself saying "yes" when you'd rather say "no"? You're not alone—many p
 eople get caught in a cycle of overcommitment.\n\nIn this noontime webinar
 \, you'll explore the essential skill of setting healthy boundaries to pro
 tect your well-being and take back control of your time\, energy\, and per
 sonal space. You'll gain a clear understanding of what boundaries are\, wh
 y they matter\, and how to recognize when they’re needed.\n\nWe’ll exp
 lore the co\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/
 classes/register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&c
