DESCRIPTION:Cardiometabolic syndrome (CMS) is a combination of metabolic d
 ysfunctions that can greatly increase the risk of heart attack\, stroke\, 
 type 2 diabetes\, and other diseases. An estimated 47 million people in th
 e US are living with cardiometabolic disorders. Knowing how to decrease yo
 ur risk can help you live a longer\, healthier life. \n\nIn this noontime 
 webinar\, you will learn the signs and stages of CMS\, review the relation
 ship between blood pressure\, cholesterol\, glucose\, and excess weight as
  it r\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/classe
 s/register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=1252
